{"status": "supplement", "name": "矩阵的迹", "card": {"name": "矩阵的迹", "concept": "矩阵的迹是方阵主对角线元素之和。它在线性代数中用于刻画特征值之和、相似不变量，并在矩阵恒等式和微分中常见。", "formulas": ["\\operatorname{tr}(A)=\\sum_{i=1}^n a_{ii}", "\\operatorname{tr}(A+B)=\\operatorname{tr}(A)+\\operatorname{tr}(B)", "\\operatorname{tr}(AB)=\\operatorname{tr}(BA)"], "example": "A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\3&4\\end{pmatrix}，则 \\operatorname{tr}(A)=1+4=5。", "pitfall": "误以为 \\operatorname{tr}(AB)=\\operatorname{tr}(A)\\operatorname{tr}(B)；非方阵没有迹。", "prereq": ["矩阵", "矩阵乘法"], "source": "AI 补充 · 未经老师确认", "verified": false}, "suggests": [{"name": "邻接矩阵（Adjacency Matrix）", "course": "数据结构与算法分析", "doc_id": "graph_bfs", "score": 0.4}]}